          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪಕ್ಕೆಲುಬು — pakkelubu — \"a rib\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಿದ್ದಾಗ ಅವನ ಪಕ್ಕೆಲುಬು ಮುರಿಯಿತು. biddāga avana pakkelubu muriyitu. When he fell, he broke a rib."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪಕ್ಕ, the side + ಎಲುಬು, a bone: a bone of the side."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪಕ್ಕೆಲುಬು (pakkelubu) is a Kannada compound: pakka, \"the side\", which goes back to Sanskrit pakṣa, \"wing, side\", through Prakrit pakkha (CDIAL 7627), and elubu, \"a bone\", which DEDR 839 lists among the native words for bone."
            }
          ]
        },
