              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ತೋಳುಗಳು, tōḷugaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೈ is the hand or the whole arm; ತೋಳು (tōḷu) is from shoulder to elbow, and also a sleeve."
            }
          ]
        },
