              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕಾಲಿಗೆ ಗಾಯ ಆಗಿದ್ದರಿಂದ ಅವನು ಕುಂಟುತ್ತಿದ್ದನು. kālige gāya āgiddarinda avanu kuṇṭuttiddanu. Because his leg was hurt, he was limping."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಕುಂಟಿದೆ, kuṇṭide."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕುಂಟ is a lame man; ಕುಂಟಾಟ is hopscotch."
            }
          ]
        },
